    Bind encoded asset tables into the model anchor
    
    Add the general asset table identity and layout from the trusted plan, build the encoded table from the same read-only asset rows through the existing table base, and bind the table root and record into the anchor as an extra leaf record. The verifier recomputes the identity from the trusted plan and rebuilds the anchor; the raw row commitment and every existing check are unchanged. Production plans pass no table inputs yet, so no production anchor, proof or byte changes.

